    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <img class="about-photo" src="/images/photo_of_me.jpeg" alt="Photo of me" />
      <p>Hi, I'm Conor!</p>
      <p>I enjoy turning messy, unstructured data into reliable inputs for machine-learning systems, building practical pipelines around them, and communicating technical ideas clearly.</p>
      <p>Outside university, I train in <strong>Judo</strong>, which inspired my latest project: an AI-assisted coach for post-match analysis. It currently takes raw match footage and automatically identifies and clips attempted throws. The next stage is developing a model that can provide coaching insights by analysing why each attempt succeeded or failed.</p>
      </div>

